Value Required MAC_ADDRESS ([0-9A-Fa-f]{4}(?:-[0-9A-Fa-f]{4}){2})
Value Required VLAN_VSI (\S+)
Value Required LEARNED_FROM (\S+(?:\s+\S+)*)
Value Required TYPE (\S+)

Start
  ^MAC\s+Address\s+VLAN/VSI(?:/BD)?\s+Learned-From\s+Type\s*$$
  ^-+
  ^${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${VLAN_VSI}\s+${LEARNED_FROM}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Total(?:\s+items)?(?:\s+displayed)?\s*[:=]\s*\d+\s*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
